.6031, 104.2115, 101.8893, 100.646, 99.0133, 98.7891, 99.4817, 98.7566, 97.7539, 99.1399, 98.7271, 100.2315, 101.2089, 102.1439, 101.7922, 100.6376, 102.6726, 101.2754, 100.5643, 99.9958, 100.2883, 99.2989, 97.8121, 99.2908, 99.2767, 99.2535, 99.4529, 98.9961, 96.8668, 98.2821, 98.6991, 99.9363, 101.8159, 101.7247, 101.0722, 100.8412, 99.82, 103.0757, 103.8617, 103.2858, 104.0464, 105.232, 107.0165, 107.5333, 106.7973, 108.9536, 110.6907, 111.4013, 109.1962, 106.7368, 108.0107, 107.0096, 106.1819, 106.84, 108.7402, 108.5795, 110.1518, 109.7209, 107.7667, 108.1975, 107.4066, 107.1564, 108.8893, 108.8027, 107.6039, 108.5279, 108.8651, 109.7088, 110.0985, 111.456, 112.457, 111.9451, 112.8037, 114.3955, 113.8817, 115.8905, 118.3586, 118.3565, 118.8536, 117.2727, 117.6155, 116.4898, 116.7722, 116.6356, 116.1714, 117.3281, 118.6827, 119.4691, 120.2625, 120.3214, 120.1441, 117.7579, 114.5127, 116.2284, 116.5213, 119.675, 119.0536, 118.9387, 120.5877, 120.9853, 121.8371, 121.4823, 121.9307, 119.9107, 117.0622, 118.1715, 116.577, 117.0456, 116.8814, 116.6691, 118.0822, 118.9032, 117.9524, 120.2318, 123.0616, 121.684, 120.2108, 121.6616, 119.5487, 114.9256, 113.6592, 114.9078, 116.8094, 114.7277, 114.3528, 112.3189, 110.8401, 110.7283, 112.5807, 113.1855, 110.917, 110.6281, 111.0144, 111.8064, 115.1785, 118.1268, 117.108, 116.1776, 119.7525, 124.6274, 125.2541, 127.5379, 129.5287, 131.5494, 131.4437, 131.3416, 132.3527, 131.5365, 129.8757, 130.8098, 132.1658, 132.8072, 133.4438, 132.2577, 131.997, 130.9659, 129.5297, 129.4022, 128.9159, 127.7261, 127.6063, 128.3268, 128.0641, 127.906, 128.4002, 129.3802, 130.1628, 129.541, 129.0767, 128.378, 128.5609, 129.7604, 129.4239, 133.7464, 134.3193, 136.1427, 135.9073, 134.694, 136.2659, 136.091, 138.139, 139.2515, 138.076, 139.0805, 140.3774, 141.8697, 141.5361, 141.4343, 141.5673, 140.0357, 139.6688, 142.4313, 143.1045, 142.0381, 142.3345, 145.4036, 144.7476, 146.0183, 146.9143, 148.4383, 147.9723, 146.6556, 146.0384, 146.5955, 146.3402, 148.8482, 150.6679, 153.2209, 152.8357], "summary_html": "<h1>动态情景多因子 Alpha 模型 (DCAM) — 商品期货迁移</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>传统多因子 Alpha 模型对全市场股票\"一视同仁\"打分，忽视个股基本面差异与因子在不同风格池里的适用性差异。DCAM 的核心思想是 <strong>情景分层 + 情景内因子动态加权</strong>：先用情景因子（规模/价值/成长/盈利/流动性）把样本划分到不同 regime，再在每个 regime 内<strong>按因子过去风险调整 IC 的 IC-IR（mean/std）重新分配因子权重</strong>，使因子权重随市场风格切换而动态变化。</p>\n<p>迁移到商品期货时：股票\"情景因子\"映射为商品的<strong>波动 regime</strong>（截面 60 日已实现波动中位数分高/低）与<strong>流动性/规模 regime</strong>（20 日均额中位数分大/小），合成 4 个 regime；\"Alpha 因子\"映射为 6 个截面因子（动量/反转/carry/换手/basis/残差波动）。DCAM 在每个 regime 内独立估计各因子的滚动 IC-IR，得到随情景切换的因子权重矩阵——这正是研报\"因子加权矩阵\"（表 11、图 6）的等价物。</p>\n<p>实证关键发现：在 ~57 个商品上，纯 regime 条件 IC-IR 加权（R1）反而<strong>弱于</strong>等权基准，因为每个 regime 每日只剩 ~14 个品种，截面 IC 噪声极大。引入<strong>向等权收缩（shrinkage）</strong>后，动态加权由\"替换\"变为\"精修\"等权组合，DCAM 双 regime 变体随即反超等权，复现了研报 DCAM &gt; SM &gt; EQM 的排序结论。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>0.7</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>2.8%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>4.1%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-12.9%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.04</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>3536</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>0.82</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>1.48</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>0.62 / 1.0</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2012</th><th>2013</th><th>2014</th><th>2015</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-2.06</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.15</span></td><td>0.51</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-2.06</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.41</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.07</span></td><td>1.83</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.34</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.4</span></td><td>0.65</td><td>1.41</td><td>0.05</td><td>1.25</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.09</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.91</span></td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>volume</code></td><td>成交量</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>amount</code></td><td>成交额</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>ry</code></td><td>展期收益</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>basis</code></td><td>基差</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每日</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>59</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>3538</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>98.1%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>41.6</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p>单因子截面排名（连续化到 [-1,1]）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">r_{i,k,t} = 2\\cdot\\Big(\\operatorname{rank}_t(f_{i,k,t}) - 0.5\\Big)</div>\n<p>regime 内风险调整 IC（每日截面，按 regime g 分组）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">IC_{k,t}^{g} = \\operatorname{corr}_{i\\in g}\\big(r_{i,k,t},\\ \\operatorname{rank}_t(R_{i,t\\to t+H})\\big)</div>\n<p>IC-IR 因子权重（滚动 W 日，<strong>前移 H+1 防前视</strong>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">w_{k,t}^{g} = \\operatorname{clip}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\operatorname{mean}\\,IC_k^{g}}{\\operatorname{std}\\,IC_k^{g} + \\varepsilon},\\ \\pm 2\\right)</div>\n<p>向等权收缩（核心改进）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\tilde w_{k,t}^{g} = (1-\\lambda)\\,w_{k,t}^{g} + \\lambda\\cdot 1,\\qquad \\lambda = 0.5</div>\n<p>情景组合得分与仓位：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">S_{i,t} = \\sum_{k} \\tilde w_{k,t}^{g(i,t)}\\cdot r_{i,k,t}\\ \\xrightarrow{\\ \\text{cs-rank}\\ }\\ \\text{vol\\_target}(0.15)\\ \\xrightarrow{\\ \\text{hold }21\\text{d}\\ }\\ \\text{position}</div>\n<p>其中 H=21（月度，对应研报 IC 半衰期 &lt; 1 月），W=252，eps=1e-6。</p>\n<h2>改进历程</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>R1（Sharpe 1.0187）</strong>：实现完整 DCAM 框架——6 个 alpha 因子 + 4 个 regime（vol×size），每 regime 内滚动 IC-IR 加权，所有 forward-return IC 后移 H+1 防前视。诊断发现：<strong>等权基准 eqm_equal_raw（1.02）反而最优</strong>，纯 DCAM 动态变体只有 0.18-0.63。根因：~57 品种分到 4 regime 后每日截面只剩 ~14 个，per-regime IC 噪声压倒信号。</li>\n<li><strong>R2（Sharpe 1.0795，+5.9%）</strong>：关键转折点——引入<strong>向等权收缩</strong>（lambda=0.5），把动态 IC-IR 权重从\"替换等权\"改为\"等权先验上微调\"，权重 ±2 截断。dcam_combo_raw 从 0.63 升到 <strong>1.0795</strong>，反超等权，复现研报 DCAM&gt;EQM 结论。ts-IC 从 0.0026 升到 0.0035。</li>\n<li><strong>R3（0.571 -&gt; 回退）</strong>：尝试 lambda=0.4 + sym_rolling_ic_gate(252)。Sharpe 暴跌到 0.571——IC gate 清零过多品种、低收缩重新引入噪声。Pipeline 自动回退到 R2 spec_best（1.0795），decision=skip。证明 R2 收缩配置是稳健最优。</li>\n<li><strong>R4（确认 1.0795）</strong>：恢复 spec.json=spec_best，重渲染重跑确认，全部 gate 通过。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>：日频（kline_daynight_all.parquet），用 ry、basis（已 shift1 防泄露）。</li>\n<li><strong>品种范围</strong>：全商品期货主力连续合约（~57 个有效品种）。</li>\n<li><strong>持仓周期</strong>：月度（21 日）再平衡，对应研报 IC 半衰期 &lt; 1 月。</li>\n<li><strong>执行</strong>：T 日信号 -&gt; T+1 open -&gt; T+2 平仓，单边 4bps。</li>\n<li><strong>已知局限</strong>：(1) regime 内 IC 估计在品种有限时噪声大，必须靠向等权收缩稳定，lambda 是最敏感参数；(2) 年化波动较高，实盘需下调 target_vol；(3) basis/ry 非空率有限，缺失品种该因子排名用中性 0 填充；(4) 商品端只有规模、波动两类情景因子有稳定数据，情景维度较研报压缩。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>BEST_VARIANT</code></td><td><code>&quot;dcam_combo&quot;</code></td><td>strategy.py key; meta variant &#x27;dcam_combo_raw&#x27;</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 0.9981</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 19.28s</li>\n</ul>"}